# Ambassador K'Ehleyr ({2}{W}), vigilance: "Parley — At the beginning of combat on your turn, each player reveals the top
# card of their library, then draws a card. For each nonland card revealed this way, put a +1/+1 counter on Ambassador
# K'Ehleyr." Cast on turn 1 off three Moxen, its first combat reveals a Savannah Lions from Bot1's all-nonland library (one
# counter) and an Island from Bot2's (a land: none), and each player draws the card they revealed.

